  "body": "## Summary\n- `bullet coding submit|status` posts the same `run_coding` envelope as Portal; `stop` is typed `STOP_UNIMPLEMENTED`.\n- The command worker executes `run_coding` by spawning `bullet-runner` (Claude dogfood flags or `--signed-in-executable` for Codex/Cursor/agy). `sim` and `SimAdapter` are refused.\n- Inventory pins move to 1171 / standalone 1125 from `cargo nextest list`.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cargo test -p bullet --bin bullet -- coding::`\n- [x] `cargo test -p bullet-runner` worker coding/state + runner provider selection\n- [x] `cargo test -p bullet-adapters --test run_coding_admission`\n- [x] Live loopback farmd: four PENDING `run_coding` command ids under `/tmp/bf-product-turns-20260909`\n- [ ] Hosted lint/fast after this source-only PR (no workflow YAML)\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
